    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>The archfey Baba Yaga made many of these magic brooms, and no two look exactly alike. While holding the broom, you can take a Magic action to turn it into an @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.bestiaire.Actor.E6uwWQ0sDegrDQgR]{Animated Broom} under your control; it then moves to an unoccupied space as close to you as possible. The broom acts right after you on your Initiative count and stays animated until you take a Bonus Action and speak a command word to make it inanimate again.</p><p>On your turn, if the broom is within 30 feet of you and you don’t have the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition, you can command it mentally (no action required). You decide what action it takes and where it moves on its next turn, or you can give it a general command, such as attacking your enemies or guarding a location.</p><p>If the broom drops to 0 Hit Points, it shatters and is destroyed. If it returns to its inanimate form before losing all its Hit Points, it regains all of them.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-I8QwkH3nkTZVsnCb\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Animate Broom</em> place le balai animé du Bestiaire Owidyn.</p></section>",
